  KappaHasher: streaming BLAKE3 hasher from the hologram-ai browser pipeline.
  API: new(), update(bytes), finalize() -> "blake3:" ++ hex(digest).

  Properties (from functions/A_addressing.md AD-03):
    - chunked_kappa(b, c) = kappa_of(b) for any chunking c
      (chunked/incremental hashing equals whole-input hashing)
    - kappa_of(b) = "blake3:" ++ hex(BLAKE3(b))

  BLAKE3 (Section 2): 7 rounds, 16-word state, 8-word chaining value.
  IV: 6A09E667 BB67AE85 3C6EF372 A54FF53A 510E527F 9B05688C 1F83D9AB 5BE0CD19
  Message permutation: [2, 6, 3, 10, 7, 0, 4, 13, 1, 11, 12, 5, 9, 14, 15, 8]
-->
